@title Welcome to Customer Success
@subtitle For the November 2026 cohort at Larkspur Software
@author Nadia Farouk, VP of Customer Success

Hello, and welcome to the team!

We are 42 people spread across Denver, Dublin and Singapore, which means someone on Customer Success is almost always awake and helping a customer. We care about our customers' outcomes as much as they do, and we look out for each other. You are joining a team that is glad you are here.

# Your first week
- **Monday**: laptop pickup at 10:00, followed by a welcome breakfast.
- **Tuesday**: product deep dive with the Solutions team.
- **Wednesday**: shadow two customer calls.
- **Thursday**: support tooling training.
- **Friday**: lunch with your onboarding buddy.

# Your first 90 days
**By day 30**, your job is to learn the product. Use it the way our customers do, ask lots of questions, and sit in on as many calls as you can.

**By day 60**, you will own five accounts alongside your onboarding buddy. They will be right there with you as you build relationships and handle your first escalations.

**By day 90**, you will run quarterly business reviews on your own. By then you will know the product and your customers well enough to lead the conversation.

# People to know
- **Nadia Farouk**, VP of Customer Success
- **Owen Achterberg**, Head of Support
- **Priyanka Rao**, Enablement lead
- **Jonas Weber**, IT help desk lead

! Tip: the `#cs-newbies` channel is the best place to ask anything. No question is too small.

We are so glad you are joining us, and I cannot wait to see what you will do here. My door, and my inbox, are always open.

Warmly,
Nadia Farouk
VP of Customer Success
